  hook patch scaffolding, and the manifest-filter + reassembly design. The DASH
  period-stripping rules follow HuluMpdFilter, itself after ajstrick81's
  PlutoDashManifestProbe.
  Source: https://github.com/ajstrick81/morphe-androidtv-patches

